1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:01,509
(Penny:)Yeah.

2
00:00:02,557 --> 00:00:05,307
(Leonard:)Funny how things work out.

3
00:00:05,893 --> 00:00:08,063
But he loved the companionship
and the wisdom...

4
00:00:08,229 --> 00:00:10,729
(Toby:)...that his own father failed to provide.

5
00:00:11,774 --> 00:00:13,604
(Sheldon:)Your parents made the right decision.

6
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:22,160
(Toby:)I cannot work like this.

7
00:00:25,955 --> 00:00:28,245
[MAN SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY
ON TV]

8
00:00:31,669 --> 00:00:37,259
(Toby:)This is amazing, just sitting on a couch
watching TV with a woman.

9
00:00:37,425 --> 00:00:42,885
(Toby:)Not being drunk or high
or wondering if you're a dude down there.

10
00:00:44,682 --> 00:00:48,222
(Penny:)Leo, you are a very sweet,
really funny guy.

11
00:00:48,394 --> 00:00:50,524
(Penny:)You're gonna do okay.

12
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,020
(Toby:)One day at a time, Penny.

13
00:00:56,652 --> 00:00:58,862
(Toby:)One day at a time.

14
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:06,037
How long is he going to stay here?

15
00:01:06,204 --> 00:01:09,954
(Sheldon:)He's a homeless drug addict, Leonard,
where is he going to go?

16
00:01:10,166 --> 00:01:12,876
(Sheldon:)Boy, you have a lot to learn about lying.

